## Project Structure

```
.
├── compose.yml               # Docker Compose configuration for services (web app, postgres)
├── Dockerfile                # Dockerfile for building the Spring Boot application
├── mvnw                      # Maven Wrapper script (for Unix-like systems)
├── mvnw.cmd                  # Maven Wrapper script (for Windows)
├── pom.xml                   # Maven project object model file
├── README.md                 # Project README file
├── data/
│   ├── migrate.load          # PgLoader script for SQLite to PostgreSQL migration
│   └── migrate.sh            # Shell script to execute PgLoader
└── src/
    ├── main/
    │   ├── java/             # Java source code
    │   │   └── net/digitalbooster/musicshop/
    │   │       ├── MusicshopApplication.java   # Main Spring Boot application class
    │   │       ├── config/           # Spring configuration classes (JPA, Security)
    │   │       ├── controller/       # Spring MVC controllers (Admin, Cart, Catalog, Checkout, etc.)
    │   │       ├── model/            # JPA entities (Album, Artist, Cart, Customer, Invoice, Track, User)
    │   │       ├── repository/       # Spring Data JPA repositories
    │   │       └── service/          # Business logic services
    │   └── resources/        # Application resources
    │       ├── application-postgres.properties # PostgreSQL specific properties
    │       ├── application-sqlite.properties   # SQLite specific properties
    │       ├── application.properties          # Default application properties
    │       ├── static/               # Static web resources (CSS, JS, images)
    │       │   └── css/site.css      # Custom CSS
    │       └── templates/            # Thymeleaf HTML templates
    │           └── fragments/menu.html # Reusable menu fragment
    └── test/                 # Test source code
```

